<title>SOUTH KOREA: BANK OF KOREA TO SUPPLY ONE TRLN WON THROUGH REPOS.</title>
<headline>BANK OF KOREA TO SUPPLY ONE TRLN WON THROUGH REPOS.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Korea, South Korea's central bank, said on Tuesday it planned to supply one trillion won to banks by the end of the day through four-day repurchase agreements.</p>
</text>
